<span class="line"><span style="color:#7F848E;font-style:italic;">     * </span><span style="color:#C678DD;font-style:italic;">@return</span><span style="color:#7F848E;font-style:italic;"> Returns 0 on success, or a non-zero error code on failure.</span></span>
